"l":270},{"i":"27:76:8","a":"أَكْثَرَ","t":"most","p":"ADJ","tr":"akthara","f":["MS","ACC"],"r":63,"l":140},{"i":"27:76:9","a":"ٱلَّذِى","t":"(of) that","p":"REL","tr":"alladhī","f":["MS"],"l":7},{"i":"27:76:10","a":"هُمْ","t":"they","p":"PRON","tr":"hum","f":["3MP"],"l":11},{"i":"27:76:11","a":"فِيهِ","t":"in it","p":"P","tr":"fīhi","l":3,"g":[["فِي","P","stem",""],["هِ","PRON","suffix","PRON:3MS"]]},{"i":"27:76:12","a":"يَخْتَلِفُونَ","t":"differ","p":"V","tr":"yakhtalifūna","f":["IMPF","(VIII)","3MP"],"r":89,"l":336,"g":[["يَخْتَلِفُ","V","stem","IMPF|(VIII)|3MP"],["ونَ","PRON","suffix","PRON:3MP"]]},{"e":"٧٦","v":"27:76"}]}],"verses":[{"k":"27:64","t":"Is He [not best] who begins creation and then repeats it and who provides for you from the heaven and earth? Is there a deity with Allāh? Say, \"Produce your proof, if you should be truthful.\"","j":20,"h":39,"s":27,"a":64,"sd":null},{"k":"27:65","t":"Say, \"None in the heavens and earth knows the unseen except Allāh, and they do not perceive when they will be resurrected.\"","j":20,"h":39,"s":27,"a":65,"sd":null},{"k":"27:66","t":"Rather, their knowledge is arrested concerning the Hereafter. Rather, they are in doubt about it. Rather, they are, concerning it, blind.","j":20,"h":39,"s":27,"a":66,"sd":null},{"k":"27:67","t":"And those who disbelieve say, \"When we have become dust as well as our forefathers, will we indeed be brought out [of the graves]?","j":20,"h":39,"s":27,"a":67,"sd":null},{"k":"27:68","t":"We have been promised this, we and our forefathers, before. This is not but legends of the former peoples.\"","j":20,"h":39,"s":27,"a":68,"sd":null},{"k":"27:69","t":"Say, [O Muḥammad], \"Proceed [i.e., travel] through the land and observe how was the end of the criminals.\"","j":20,"h":39,"s":27,"a":69,"sd":null},{"k":"27:70","t":"And grieve not over them or be in distress from what they conspire.","j":20,"h":39,"s":27,"a":70,"sd":null},{"k":"27:71","t":"And they say, \"When is [the fulfillment of] this promise, if you should be truthful?\"","j":20,"h":39,"s":27,"a":71,"sd":null},{"k":"27:72","t":"Say, \"Perhaps it is close behind you [i.e., very near] - some of that for which you are impatient.","j":20,"h":39,"s":27,"a":72,"sd":null},{"k":"27:73","t":"And indeed, your Lord is the possessor of bounty for the people, but most of them are not grateful.\"","j":20,"h":39,"s":27,"a":73,"sd":null},{"k":"27:74","t":"And indeed, your Lord knows what their breasts conceal and what they declare.","j":20,"h":39,"s":27,"a":74,"sd":null},{"k":"27:75","t":"And there is nothing concealed within the heaven and the earth except that it is in a clear Register.","j":20,"h":39,"s":27,"a":75,"sd":null},{"k":"27:76","t":"Indeed, this Qur’ān relates to the Children of Israel most of that over which they disagree.","j":20,"h":39,"s":27,"a":76,"sd":null}],"juz":20,"hizb":39,"surahs":[27],"sajdah":false}